-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §31 חישוב ערך שעה: the hour's value — its
-- base for substitution, school activities and a deduction for an hour's
-- absence, and its computation: the base for a 100% position over 4.33
-- weeks times 36 hours.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `31 חישוב ערך שעה`

DECLARE `use of the hour value` IS ONE OF
    `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour`
    `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, paid instead of it (§29(ד))`
    `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§29(ה))`
    `a school-activities hour`
    `a deduction for an hour's absence`

@desc The monthly amounts the base of an hour's value is made of, for a 100% position.
DECLARE `pay for the hour value` HAS
    `combined salary`                     IS A NUMBER @desc שכר משולב for a full position; from §35's tables, an input
    `special-education allowance`         IS A NUMBER @desc גמול חינוך מיוחד, for a full position
    `pensionable role allowances`         IS A NUMBER @desc the role allowances counted in the salary determining the pension, that the teacher earns in the regular salary
    `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a special-education, מתי"א, therapeutic-centre or integrating teacher (31(א)(1))

-- (א)(1): a substitution hour, save one in place of a stay hour under
-- §29(ד): the combined salary; a special-education teacher substituting in
-- a special-education class adds the special-education allowance.
@ref akn:art_31__para_a akn:art_31__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base under 31(א)(1)` p IS
    IF p's `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class`
    THEN p's `combined salary` PLUS p's `special-education allowance`
    ELSE p's `combined salary`

-- (א)(2)–(4): a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, a
-- school-activities hour and a deduction for an hour's absence: the
-- combined salary and the pensionable role allowances.
@ref akn:art_31__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_31__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_31__para_a__subpara_4
GIVEN p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base under 31(א)(2)–(4)` p IS
    p's `combined salary` PLUS p's `pensionable role allowances`

-- Which base a use takes. F-ofek-hadash-base-31-a: (1) takes every
-- substitution hour except the one "במקום שעת שהיה כאמור בסעיף 29 (ד)",
-- and (2) takes every substitution hour "במקום שעת שהיה" — so the hour of
-- §29(ה), in place of a stay hour that is done on another day, is in both,
-- with two different bases. The reading adopted (convention
-- precedence.specific): (2), which speaks of exactly the hour in place of a
-- stay hour.
GIVEN u IS A `use of the hour value`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the clauses of 31(א) whose words take` u IS
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour` THEN LIST "(1)"
    WHEN `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, paid instead of it (§29(ד))` THEN LIST "(2)"
    WHEN `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§29(ה))` THEN LIST "(1)", "(2)"
    WHEN `a school-activities hour` THEN LIST "(3)"
    WHEN `a deduction for an hour's absence` THEN LIST "(4)"

GIVEN u IS A `use of the hour value`, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the hour value` u p IS
    IF u EQUALS `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour`
    THEN `the base under 31(א)(1)` p
    ELSE `the base under 31(א)(2)–(4)` p

`the hour of §29(ה) falls under two clauses of 31(א)` MEANS
    count (`the clauses of 31(א) whose words take` `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§29(ה))`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the hour of §29(ה) falls under two clauses of 31(א)`

-- (ב): the hour's value is the base for a 100% position over 4.33 weeks
-- times 36 hours. No rounding is stated (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_31__para_b akn:art_31__para_b/p2 akn:art_31__para_b/p3
`weeks in a month` MEANS 4.33
`hours in a full week` MEANS 36

GIVEN base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value` base IS
    base DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month` TIMES `hours in a full week`)

GIVEN u IS A `use of the hour value`, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value for` u p IS
    `the hour value` (`the base of the hour value` u p)

-- A placeholder teacher: a combined salary of 7,794 (50 an hour, 4.33 × 36
-- being 155.88) and 779.40 of pensionable role allowances (5 an hour more).
`a teacher for the hour value` MEANS
    `pay for the hour value` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 7794
        `special-education allowance` IS 0
        `pensionable role allowances` IS 779.4
        `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `weeks in a month` TIMES `hours in a full week` EQUALS 155.88
#ASSERT `the hour value for` `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour` `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 7794 DIVIDED BY 155.88
#ASSERT `the hour value for` `a school-activities hour` `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 55
